{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：23:11 2026-10-31 HKT</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/9de6e5c2ab4a1fe4251d8c66c4f142ab/2026-10/KF_LOGO_13__2.png\"/>\n<p>萬聖節正日全港多區充滿節日氣氛，除了傳統熱點中環蘭桂坊被「嘩鬼」擠得水洩不通、人龍一度延至幹諾道中外，本港多個地區，如旺角及啟德體育園等亦推出各式萬聖夜慶祝活動與主題市集，吸引大批市民，及內地遊客精心打扮應節。</p>\n<h2>▼▼▼中環蘭桂芳萬聖節派對▼▼▼</h2>\n<p>雖然警方晚上7時半左右已指蘭桂坊一帶已非常擠迫，呼籲市民考慮轉往其他地區慶祝，不過，仍然大批市民希望進入蘭桂坊，人龍一度延至干諾道中一帶，即使要排隊兩小時入場亦無阻市民興致，場面相當墟冚。</p>\n<img alt=\"踏入萬聖節正日，大批市民、遊客「逼爆」中環蘭桂坊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/4825d69c2b529bcb83d7c0f70191f0d7/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_210253226.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/92e5b25178d14debdf6578268ce32503/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_210253226_01.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/e08b50074cb50e2f2b841897dab1cae5/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_210253226_02.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/dd8b44b7f88d86232aa06bdd4a388087/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_210253226_03_0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/15d8d4dd0adb45275a8b599a9cb238ce/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_210253226_04_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蜘蛛俠是不少大人細路熱門的變裝與打卡角色。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/f622a1edaa9ef679784360572b7d559d/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_210253226_05_0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/27383c58d42ce2fa859b4bd2e695809e/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_210253226_06.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/bd321086768a07282d4de15e6958055e/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_210253226_07.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"脆薯餅平時只會在早餐時段見到，但在晚上的蘭桂坊都可以見到。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/b79d26b0a9da7a609828c7d545524de4/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_210253226_08.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/6ff514ebcac13b71a45b7960ebf6012a/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_210253226_09.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有人模仿經典遊戲《植物大戰殭屍》角色。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/b8f83b7b7b5c65d19385d6897e12cb7b/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_210253226_10.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/2c0ee5759dd14b1abe20f674e4fed8fc/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_210253226_11.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/427a6480e0504b3c7298cc95c6c11538/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_210253226_12.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/488692747e74bb47aed8e74f061e2097/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_210253226_13.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/be867db2110e8197b6a5a1f9ad927702/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_210253226_14.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/ac2593b59fd11967e45943befbd59162/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_210253226_15.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/71e847be4090c69bd4073087447773a7/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_210253226_16.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/ae429799ac52f90904e00b0f603286ab/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_210253226_19.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"市民自製卡通《101斑點狗》主題的衣物、公仔慶祝萬聖節。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/51a204f5caaae2869358ab4edaa933b8/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_212922603_0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/cc76d54f6211081fdebeae062217cc7b/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_212922603_01_0.jpg\"/>\n<h2>▼▼▼旺角砵蘭街萬聖節派對▼▼▼</h2>\n<p>旺角街頭夜色未濃已充滿熱鬧節日氣氛。朗豪坊繼2006年後再次舉辦的大型戶外狂歡活動，吸引大批市民及旅客盛裝出席，場面盛大，頗有「百鬼夜行」的熱鬧感覺，當中港式紅Van「旺角妖巴」更成為矚目打卡熱點。</p>\n<img alt=\"今日是萬聖節，朗豪坊舉辦活動響應萬聖節狂熱，吸引了不少市民盛裝打扮到場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/50b202576c2f9168217672ea39c8ebad/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有市民扮演天使、女巫等經典角色。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/7ab1c119a02184c559bedace18f14952/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_01.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/f1b5cae82b84d6b8c2abc9e00124c53c/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"經典港式紅Van「旺角妖巴」化身為免費接駁車，來往旺角朗豪坊與佐敦白加士街。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/e6309ac1371029f55486ae3ee7acf249/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_06.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有市民更帶同自己愛犬與紅Van合影。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/a67fe2854e3591e7e5942fabaee92abb/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_03.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"在萬聖節「扮鬼扮馬」並不是人類的專利，小狗也換上萬聖節裝束。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/7a325104cfaed7fd526e2a92dfea5929/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_04.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"不少人到紅Van內「打卡」影相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/111603a87ab9ded60fb109ce0c66b562/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_05.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"國產3D動畫電影《牛來》主角牛來亦是市民今年裝扮的角色之一。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/fab50213a2ac5f4668399ba43ed0f0c2/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_08.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"為更應節，有不少人會為自己的服裝「加工」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/de514e7d0a167b68d03eac0a950a77e1/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_09.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《新警察故事》吳彥祖的角色Joe亦是近年萬聖節，不少年輕人爭相 Cosplay 的熱門選擇。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/e441bebee8af8c6760c694b7ee0c5e45/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「奶蛙」除了出現在大學校園亦出現在旺角街頭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/b2fa19a67e8396e7bcb3a90a591c842d/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《阿拉丁》茉莉公主都要在紅Van前拍照留念。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/10f7d5f50d67d1e60dda5084603e4051/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小狗都要外出慶節！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/d5fa602de9a6c79ef3509897de0b7107/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《詭修女》及《玩轉極樂園》(Coco)也是近年不少年輕人爭相 Cosplay 的熱門選擇。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/eebe3108916bc4c713a6162bca8ab545/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_15.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/f5c3169606168ad52962d9c4a08e4cc5/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_16.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/d6b4320c339a0fdaab901679b462b6df/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_14.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/cc30c6434553047235f220462c4c7523/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_17.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/929143236e9520d140561b61d326203c/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_18.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/f070df42c63f3ceb655444a4a95ee205/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_19.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/98aca97d175dcde63e73e6bc059be570/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_20.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/55263166a56677f8db3964dbd61af3e3/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_21.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/3a0ae008e073a70840ff9c89767fa317/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_22.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"天使與魔鬼、《哈利·波特》雷文克勞學院學生與茄汁。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/0c34410f0f974ad32536f9c4e0f4f87a/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_23.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/91869dc9d7338a533e57941934b8238f/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_24.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/05d3de4c33ae3ebbd35ed5c26b634f85/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_25.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/1adb801217d3c839a1acf76d42c1f978/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182507386_08.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/f2b827b7269daf08d7eea78c80bd6ff6/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_27.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"萬聖節也要「發」財。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/191604859aeccaeaa815cc4a86b50580/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_28.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/677f7f9a624e2a0b4af0874db52eb752/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有人裝扮成《五星級大鼠》及內地人氣餐飲品牌創辦人「費大廚」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/30340dc9fe8770d930620f19713dbcc0/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182507386_02_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《五星級大鼠》廚師見到《牛來》亦不忘合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/b9177c7b586dd3035a6416aee8bbdae6/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182309576_26.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有人將遊戲角色帶入真實世界，扮成熱門爬山遊戲《PEAK》角色。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/d135f500969a213a6723b6091873f909/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182507386_05_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有人將遊戲角色帶入真實世界，扮成熱門爬山遊戲《PEAK》角色。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/98e21197f4f8f76188114836b629ef5c/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182507386_06.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有人將遊戲角色帶入真實世界，扮成熱門爬山遊戲《PEAK》角色。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/3a5c954cdc9c98c04f5497913d157169/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261031_182507386_07.jpg\"/>\n<h2>▼▼▼啟德體育園萬聖節派對▼▼▼</h2>\n<p>如果說蘭桂芳是成年人的專場，那啟德就是小朋友和寵物的萬聖節樂園。雖然啟德體育園今日有加拿大巨星 The Weeknd在主場館舉行演唱會，但在場館外則完全被萬聖節的氣氛籠罩。大批家庭及狗主帶同寵物盛裝到場，更不少小朋友帶同小南瓜桶，與其他小朋友一同交換糖果應節。</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/af26620b8fdff15776ccbc0010f3bdf2/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-31_at_8_35_59_PM_1.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「啟德體育園 萬聖節派對」，吸引多個家庭寵物一同扮裝蒞臨美食海灣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/796edc92dfd64442189a2e8e620a097e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-31_at_8_19_18_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小狗也要參與萬聖節派對!\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/fa39dc94143089c153b5fddce8f46843/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-31_at_8_19_25_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"狗主Carman攜同三隻愛犬比比、Choco及Ccino到場，她認為今年萬聖節氣氛明顯較往年熱鬧，加上網上宣傳吸引，故特地前來。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/cd7dd29f805bf8fa880a6888cdc2bb12/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-31_at_8_19_21_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《星島》記者現場所見，未入黑已有不少人來到啟德美食海灣參與萬聖節市集。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/097bd8814f46775d7d3dda05cc7f98b4/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-31_at_8_19_24_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場有不少「打卡」位置讓市民拍照留念。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/961ab853c2bf2c359434e277d661ab42/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-31_at_8_19_20_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/a7845a6ae8342d5c752eb19149739d94/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-31_at_8_19_23_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Cosplay服裝及道具攤檔檔主曾先生表示，今年首次參與市集。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/e4df4fb314baffecef2b46bd8d737a2a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-31_at_8_19_22_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/1e6b28aabaeb29272763c96675512425/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-31_at_8_19_23_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Chaska小朋友今晚亦悉心打扮慶祝萬聖節。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/f33e87df59ae40f9a1f94732381eb8d4/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-31_at_8_19_19_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>▼▼▼尖東萬聖節派對▼▼▼</h2>\n<p>「TST East Halloween Beats」今日萬聖夜亦迎來壓軸高潮，活動場地尖東麼地道花園全日人頭湧湧，市民及旅客紛紛扮鬼扮馬到場，現場人聲鼎沸。活動全日錄得超過 1.8 萬人次參與。</p>\n<img alt=\"尖東麼地道花園全日人頭湧湧，市民及旅客紛紛扮鬼扮馬到場 。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/48fe24973c5fb1b6b9adc67bcca2e894/2026-10/1__3_8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"尖東麼地道花園全日人頭湧湧，市民及旅客紛紛扮鬼扮馬到場 。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/e7a7366a5167a08a6ac9cda64e0fdf8b/2026-10/179346121290384.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鬼馬市集亦匯聚多款香港地道搞鬼小食及特飲，全方位帶動尖東消費氣氛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/55439619fbb5263cd98d47f86d068c29/2026-10/179346121291025.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/7716952c084650ca09ff9be97ed124b3/2026-10/4__7.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/18577fe0fd6db45daaaba39bc61e1160/2026-10/TST_East_Halloween_Beats_1_8__0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/23bb01aed144c2996643ae49943f6efc/2026-10/TST_East_Halloween_Beats__0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/7a40d20c6e451760f90f04f3f7addae6/2026-10/TST_East_Halloween_Beats_1_8__1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"信和集團首席商務總裁蔡碧林表示『TST East Halloween Beats』反應熱烈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/28d18df164a83159e7637502d240f39f/2026-10/TST_East_Halloween_Beats_1_8_.jpg\"/>\n<p>記者：李曉林、伍萬庭、莊綽琳</p>\n<p>攝影：劉駿軒、陳浩元、莊綽琳</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:10.416197+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":650,"images":73,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T15:11:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:47.880273+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:18.910240+00:00","content_hash":"00d07f45634f9e00dc4358f50852ae3e0a51d7906918f09314668e673d3c58df","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}